    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We combined a city-building simulator and crafting\u00a0alchemy game to get an interesting turn-based strategy. In this game, you do not just build buildings, but change those that are there into the ones you need, spending and receiving resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/613b53ca0501578d8bbf05b46cb4e3af.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/d2e27dbf7429e574c6db4e7d5e90f6c2.webp?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=35 /></span>Each building can be obtained from several recipes and used in a number of recipes to obtain another building and/or resources, including units and other valuables. Thus, the same building can cost different amounts of different resources and require different amount of turns to obtain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.poster.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.webm?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.mp4?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get new building foundations by dropping matter (resources) into the rift. If the resource was one of the marked ones - you will also get research points progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, the more you interact with a particular building, the more fragility it accumulates and can disintegrate if you are not careful and do not take care to reduce this fragility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.poster.avif?t=1749023908\" width=598 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.webm?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.mp4?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/006c089020630653bdafcf32ef58f604.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=260 /></span>The <strong>core mechanics</strong> are built around combining resources and buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put resource {2} into building {1}, it transmutes into building {3} and resource {4} is created at the moment of transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recipe shown will not work instantly but with a delay of one turn {5}. The resulting building will have more fragility than the original {6}. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* - How many buildings and resources of the specified type do you currently have </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/dce6284960bbc8b9fe6ae5637f4e541e.webp?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=35 /></span>As you progress through the research map, you select building variants with different recipes and capabilities. This way, each run will be different.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We combined a city-building simulator and crafting\u00a0alchemy game to get an interesting turn-based strategy. In this game, you do not just build buildings, but change those that are there into the ones you need, spending and receiving resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/613b53ca0501578d8bbf05b46cb4e3af.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/d2e27dbf7429e574c6db4e7d5e90f6c2.webp?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=35 /></span>Each building can be obtained from several recipes and used in a number of recipes to obtain another building and/or resources, including units and other valuables. Thus, the same building can cost different amounts of different resources and require different amount of turns to obtain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.poster.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.webm?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/1f9f39444531172c7f90490d9aaaa336.mp4?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get new building foundations by dropping matter (resources) into the rift. If the resource was one of the marked ones - you will also get research points progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, the more you interact with a particular building, the more fragility it accumulates and can disintegrate if you are not careful and do not take care to reduce this fragility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.poster.avif?t=1749023908\" width=598 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.webm?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/e52f255c9f65d19c366bc533cea51889.mp4?t=1749023908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/006c089020630653bdafcf32ef58f604.avif?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=260 /></span>The <strong>core mechanics</strong> are built around combining resources and buildings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put resource {2} into building {1}, it transmutes into building {3} and resource {4} is created at the moment of transformation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recipe shown will not work instantly but with a delay of one turn {5}. The resulting building will have more fragility than the original {6}. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* - How many buildings and resources of the specified type do you currently have </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188690/extras/dce6284960bbc8b9fe6ae5637f4e541e.webp?t=1749023908\" width=600 height=35 /></span>As you progress through the research map, you select building variants with different recipes and capabilities. This way, each run will be different.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play alchemy by building a city and meeting the needs of the population. Extract matter from demonic rift and transform it into a resource. Explore your paths of transmutation. Exploit the synergy of systems to save the visiting deity. Protect it from corporate fools who do not see its power.",
